# Git branch default

- Work on the **currently checked-out branch**. Prefer **`dev`** when starting fresh.
- Do **not** create a new `codex/feat-*` (or any) branch for each chat or task.
- Only create, switch, or delete branches when the user **explicitly** asks.
- Commit / push / PR only when the user asks; do not invent a feature-branch workflow.
